+- **`hermes serve`/`/api/ws` JSON-RPC transport**: a materially better transport than tmux/`--cli` (`data/hermes-serve-verify/report.md`), now landed and LIVE-VERIFIED against the captain's real VPS (v0.21.2, `multiplex` mode).
+  `../../../bin/fm-hermes-ws.py`/`.sh` is a standalone client (session create/submit/status/history/steer/interrupt/close, both loopback-token and gated ticket auth) - see `../../../../docs/verification/hermes.md`'s "standalone JSON-RPC-over-WebSocket dispatch client" and "Live verification against the real VPS" sections for the wire-protocol grounding and the real dispatch transcript.
